OL,3,GNEWSA#100 home heating oil support
OL,4,Ascheme opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FApplications for a Stormont scheme to
OL,7,Fgive eligible households a #100 voucher
OL,8,Ftowards home heating oil costs are now
OL,9,Fopen.
OL,11,FAbout 340,000 lower-income households
OL,12,Fare expected to qualify for the payment
OL,13,Fwhich was first announced in March.
OL,15,FApplications will made via the NIdirect
OL,16,Fgovernment website from Wednesday 9
OL,17,FSeptember.
OL,19,FCommunities Minister Gordon Lyons said
OL,20,Fthe process was "easy and fast".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
